 with earlier edition and photographs of ILTermini\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>",{"id":255,"html":256},"translation","\u003Ch2> translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>",{"id":258,"html":259},"commentary","\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>It is possible that we might restore Prim[igen]ius in lines 2-3, followed by the dedicatee's age in years (vixit), but it is impossible to know given the condition of the plaque.\u003C/p>  ",{"id":261,"html":262},"bibliography","\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Ciofalo NSA 1889 92b \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001392\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001392\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> 1994 781 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Bivona 1994 131 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002137\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002137\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  ",{"id":264,"html":265},"license"," Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. ",[267,269,272,274,277,278,281,282],{"html":268},"Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa, Alex Antoniou",{"id":270,"lang":136,"html":271},"edition-interpretive","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"Dis\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Deus\">D(is)\u003C/span> · \u003Cspan data-text=\"Manibus\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Manes\">M(anibus)\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Prim\n                    ius\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" da